IMP-111 — CR-461-103 (F-78, SDV-01) pinned: a stopped root's /ws/agent session read a stale live status
Code: 53f0ae2d4e's server with temporary traces (reverted; none in the tree); stopped-delegator-views-probe --cases SDV-01; 2026-11-15
Each line: AgentStreamSequence.accept of a status event, its dispose, and unbindStoppedRun's projection (agent ids shortened).

## before (unbind on the root's unregistration): the run's own offline came after the session had left it
[F78-TRACE] accept manager AGENT_STATUS disposed=false {"status":"running","recoverableBlock":null,"agent_id":"manager"}
[F78-TRACE] accept manager AGENT_STATUS disposed=false {"status":"idle","recoverableBlock":null,"agent_id":"manager"}
[F78-TRACE] accept manager AGENT_STATUS disposed=false {"status":"offline","recoverableBlock":null,"agent_id":"manager"}
[F78-TRACE] dispose manager

## after (unbind once the run's sequence ends)
[F78-TRACE] accept manager AGENT_STATUS disposed=false {"status":"idle","recoverableBlock":null,"agent_id":"manager"}
[F78-TRACE] accept manager AGENT_STATUS disposed=false {"status":"offline","recoverableBlock":null,"agent_id":"manager"}
[F78-TRACE] dispose manager
[F78-TRACE] unbind manager current=true {"status":"offline","recoverableBlock":null,"agent_id":"manager"}

Reading: before, unbind read the live projection (idle) while the run was still in the run manager, sent it, and unsubscribed; the run's final 'offline' was accepted by its sequence but reached no session, so the Manager read idle (green) in the run list until another read. After: the session keeps the run's frames until its sequence ends (offline delivered), then unbinds; the projection then reads offline.

## SDV-01's later step ('the Manager started', intermittent, 2 of 4 runs before and after the fix)
